private_ssh_aws/
*.pem

# Real environment files. `.env` above only matches a file named exactly that,
# which is not enough: the per-service files are named .env.app, .env.redis and
# so on, and would have been committed by any `git add -A`. The *.example
# copies are the ones that belong in a public repository.
.env.*
!.env.example
Docker/env/
!Docker/env.example/

# Raw per-engine OCR benchmark output: 16 MB of JSON and page snapshots, with
# the same rendered page duplicated into every engine's directory. Regenerated
# by `python -m arabic_extraction.benchmark`, so it is derived data, not a
# deliverable. The curated findings in src/arabic_extraction/reports/ ARE
# tracked — that is the output worth reading, and the plots in it cannot be
# regenerated without the corpus.
src/arabic_extraction/results/
